etails":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SCO1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-23T12:04:51.63"},{"Id":"O_R1","Name":"Orlando Ramos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/O_R1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-13T15:05:18.1133333"},{"Id":"MRS1","Name":"Margaret R. Scarsdale","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MRS1","ResponseDate":"2023-05-23T13:36:43.6"},{"Id":"DAS1","Name":"Danillo A. Sena","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DAS1","ResponseDate":"2023-11-29T13:54:17.47"},{"Id":"PSS1","Name":"Priscila S. Sousa","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PSS1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-15T08:15:55.0466667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H656/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Arriaga of Chicopee, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 656) of Shirley B. Arriaga and others for legislation to further regulate mail in ballots.  Election Laws.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 25B of said chapter 54, as appearing in section 10 of chapter 92 of the acts of 2022, is hereby amended by adding the following paragraph:\r\n\t(l) The state secretary shall prepare uniform applications, instructions, ballot styles, envelopes, and other papers and electronic documents without distinguishing early voting by mail from absent voting under this chapter.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J15","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J15"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}